WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.848
Sketch the classroom and locate the teacher’s desk and other objects.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.855
A classroom sketch shows where objects are located using simple shapes. Draw the

00:00:09.855 --> 00:00:14.613
classroom outline, then mark the teacher’s table (Tt), board (Bb/Wb), cupboard (C)

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:16.199
and your seat (Me).

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:21.984
A label or key helps another learner read the sketch. The drawing does not need to be

00:00:21.984 --> 00:00:22.857
perfectly to scale.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.988
Walk around the class with your teacher and make a labelled bird’s-eye-view sketch.
